  "prefLabel": "Ncr 309.02 Acquisition of Real Property",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 309.02 Acquisition of Real Property. Pursuant to RSA 4:29, the department shall acquire real property by purchase or gift for the purposes of protecting species listed under Ncr 312 or exemplary natural communities.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ncr 300) #12980, eff 1-24-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ncr300.html"
